WEBVTT

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:16.750
Did you call?

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.820
Stone Keeper mipo!

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.100
You are wonderful, after all mipo!

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.130
What's so wonderful about him mepo?

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.060
I don't understand how 
women's minds work mepo.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.610
Did you want something?

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.580
We have a question.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.490
People who have the power of 
darkness have appeared again.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.540
Do you know anything about them?

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.010
I don't know exactly...

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.310
What are you doing, Pollun?

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.990
Play with me popo.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.420
No, I can't! I can't play!

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.750
As usual, you have no idea what's 
going on around you, do you?

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.430
We're having a serious discussion right now.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.700
Don't play with the Prism Stones!

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.480
Thee are mine popo.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.830
They're going to be mine popo.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.160
D-Don't be ridiculous.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.180
This is the Power of Creation!

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.740
Why would I hand something 
so precious over to you?

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.710
Let's see who can take it away popo!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.420
Come back popo!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.670
Pollun seems to like the Stone Keeper.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.380
I don't think the Stone Keeper's 
too happy about it though.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:42.110
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:47.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.530
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:06.400
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.550
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.620
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:34.040
So who are they anyway?

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.410
I don't know anything about them either.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.500
But I have a bad feeling about it.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.620
These heavy signs of 
darkness aren't ordinary.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.970
If we don't do something soon,

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.760
it could be disastrous for 
the Field of Rainbows.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.770
The three seeds that Jyaku-King threw out.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:03:00.350
The three with the power of darkness 
who have just appeared now...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.190
Will we have another battle 
over the Prism Stones again?

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.670
Nagisa... Don't tell me this is...?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.690
It's my homework for summer vacation.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.040
But it's totally blank.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.910
Today is the last day of summer vacation.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.220
Don't worry! I'll be fine.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.660
I'm the type who works better under pressure.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.210
So if I work hard on it 
tonight, I'll finish it.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.740
I sure hope so.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:38.500
"EXPLOSIVE!
 PRETTY CURE RAINBOW STORM"

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.590
What a nice night.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.570
What a nice night.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:11.770
The heavy darkness and a stillness that 
makes it seem like all life has died out.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.150
If we bring Jyaku-King back to life again,

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.500
this darkness will go on for all eternity.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:24.050
And that power is in our hands.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.410
Then we must bring Jyaku-King 
back to life right away...

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.810
No...

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.850
We must take possession 
of the Prism Stones first.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.630
Those girls, the Protectors of Light,

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.810
have the Prism Stones now.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.990
Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!!

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:47.960
The limitless powers hidden in the 
Prism Stones is just right for us.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.800
In that case...

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.970
Shall we go?

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.560
Shall we go? Shall we go?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.750
Nagisa...!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.340
Good morning.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:10.310
What's wrong Nagisa? You look terrible.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:13.360
Yesterday, I ended up staying up all night.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:17.380
But aren't you glad? Even if it 
was last minute, you finished it.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.790
I didn't finish it.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.660
I knew it was impossible 
from the beginning mepo.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:22.970
You stayed up all night for nothing mepo.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.240
Be quiet!

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:28.040
I wonder if it's because I'm dreading 
this, but my bag feels real heavy.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.950
What's all that in your bag anyway?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.970
We're only having the opening ceremony, 
and turning in our homework today.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.440
Come to think of it... 
What did I put in here?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:39.690
Popo!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.060
Pollun! When did you...?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.250
I'm going with you popo.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.690
No, you can't! You have to wait at home.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.230
I'm going with you popo! I'm going popo!!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.620
Once Pollun says something, 
he won't listen mipo.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.200
You don't have time to go back home.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.020
I guess I'll have to take him with me then.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.410
Popo!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:09.410
Will you all turn in your 
summer vacation homework now?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.180
Ms. Yoshimi...?

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:14.700
Should I go, and stand out in the hall...?

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.740
I haven't done my homework,

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.260
so I'll just stand out in the hall 
and reflect on what I've done.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:23.620
I don't know whether I should 
praise her or scold her.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.520
I'm going with you popo.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.890
What? What was that just now?

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.000
Popo?

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.730
That was me!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.330
I'm going with you popo!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:40.550
...or something like that?

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.630
Do you mean... you're going 
out in the hall, too?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.240
Oh my gosh!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:47.520
Don't tell me you forgot your 
homework, too, Yukishiro-san?

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.060
You're kidding, aren't you?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:53.320
You wouldn't forget your homework, would you?

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:55.550
Popo...

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.290
I'll go out in the hall, and 
reflect on what I've done.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.470
Popo...

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.920
Pollun!

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:10.290
Because of you, Honoka had to say 
that she forgot her homework, too.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.510
I'm bored popo! Play with me popo!

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.030
Be quiet!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.090
No popo! I don't want to popo!

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:20.300
Why are you two talking?

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:21.630
Are you reflecting on what you've done?

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.680
Yes, we are! We really regret what we did!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.630
Be quiet.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:30.070
Pollun...?

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.640
Nagisa... Where's Pollun?

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.100
Oh, no!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.110
Give me a break!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.490
I got you!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.960
You mustn't do that! You have 
to behave yourself, Pollun.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:59.790
No popo! I want to play some more popo.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:06.730
That picture is a very precious picture 
of the principal when he received

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:10.000
the first-place prize in the 
nationwide "bonsai" competition.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:13.820
How could you... How could you do this?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.470
As punishment, you'll have to pull weeds.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.610
What happened?

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:25.450
Are you reflecting on what you've 
done by pulling weeds now?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.410
We're reflecting on something else this time.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:32.670
The new term has just started, and you're 
already reflecting on more than one thing.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.560
Do your best.

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.160
We will.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.430
I'm hot! I'm sleepy!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.520
Nagisa...

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.100
I'm hot! I'm sleepy!

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.040
I'm hot! I'm sleepy!

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:48.730
Nagisa! Why don't you go and rest 
for a bit in the shade of that tree?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.550
I'll finish this up.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.610
It's okay...

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.340
But...

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.650
We'll do this together!

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:58.230
And get this over with quickly!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.150
Hang in there, Nagisa.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.940
Fight...

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.650
Be careful from now on.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.130
They did a good job of pulling 
the weeds, didn't they?

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.520
That's...?

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.180
Principal...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.060
I love your hairstyle!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.960
Let's get started.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.550
I'm going to sleep.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:50.750
As soon as I get home, I'm going to sleep.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.880
You worked hard...

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.530
Nagisa? Where's Pollun?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.450
He's gone!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:01.080
He went somewhere again. 
We'd better find him.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:06.190
Whose fault was it that we had to pull weeds!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.630
Pollun!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.780
Where are you?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:12.220
Come out! Are you here? Over here?

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.670
Calm down, Nagisa.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.560
Come out!

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.780
What? Is it night already?

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.400
It's only three o'clock.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.480
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.150
It looks like she's asleep.

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.670
Don't tell me this is...?

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:31.380
Probably...

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:33.840
Vice Principal!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:40.050
Honoka! Up there!

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:43.020
You're the ones...

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.020
Good evening.

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:48.810
Pretty Cure!

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.220
We came to get the Prism Stones.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.280
Is that where it is?

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.880
The Prism Stones! I have them now.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.510
Let me go!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.340
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.220
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.910
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.800
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.190
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.630
Go back to where you came from!

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.900
Can you make us go back?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.900
What's wrong?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:24.090
You're too soft.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.380
What is that?

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:38.070
Is that what you call fighting?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.040
This is how you fight!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.240
He's strong.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.800
What awesome power... And speed.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.010
If you don't hurry, and 
save the Stone Keeper,

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:00.750
it's going to be disastrous mipo.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.750
Black! White! Use the Marble Screw mepo!

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.800
Black Thunder!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.260
White Thunder!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:22.400
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.370
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:30.200
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:58.120
That can't be...

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.310
They diffused the Marble Screw...?

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:06.780
You bring black and white together to give 
birth to the power you call Marble Screw...

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:10.760
So we just have to divide the two powers.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:14.100
Our power has grown, hasn't it?

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.710
And yet, it has absolutely 
no effect on them...

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.740
This doesn't look good.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.440
Wa... wait!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.080
I'm exhausted.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:33.470
I can't hand the Power of Creation 
to those people from Dotsuku Zone.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:37.400
I have to entrust this power to someone 
who holds the will of light...

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.550
Mipple... Mepple... Pretty Cure...

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.070
If possible, the white one.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.120
Someone... Someone...

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.330
I sense the presence of light...

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.630
Popo?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.860
Popo...?

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.780
What are you doing in a place 
like this, Stone Keeper popo?

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.000
Of all people, it had to be you!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.180
Stone Keeper... Let's play together popo!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:11.090
I told you! You have to be aware 
of what's happening around you...

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.750
This is no time to be playing...

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.380
I feel the presence of darkness...

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:17.540
Popo?

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:21.340
I'm really doubtful... 
But it can't be helped.

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:27.010
Power of Creation... Please answer my plea...

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:31.290
Together with this seven lights, 
separate yourself from the stones!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.640
In the name of the keeper 
of the Prism Hopish,

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:39.560
I entrust the seven Prism Stones to you.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:46.980
Popo...!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.950
Popo... What happened popo?

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.590
Listen carefully, Pollun...

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:00.860
I just gave you...

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.840
Let's put an end to this game of chase...

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:09.630
Stone Keeper!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.380
Let Stone Keeper go popo!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.970
Let him go popo!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:17.560
Po... Pollun!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.130
Let him go popo... Let...

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.010
Pollun!!

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:24.850
Pollun!

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.890
Stone Keeper!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.610
Too bad...

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:30.560
You're too late.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.520
We don't need you two anymore.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.570
Black! White!

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:48.520
How boring! They hardly 
show any resistance...

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.400
We're wasting our time.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:52.990
You can't... popo.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.050
Farewell, Protectors of the Light!

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:00.510
No... popo...

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:05.590
You mustn't pick on them popo!

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:08.050
Pollun!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:14.400
POPO!

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:27.300
I give you the power of light popo!

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:50.190
What is this?

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.460
A bracelet?

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.430
It's the "Pretty Cure Rainbow Bracelet"!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.060
Pretty Cure Rainbow Bracelet?

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.140
What's that?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.370
They're fast!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.150
Is this...?

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:06.750
My body feels light.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.220
Wow...

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.010
That power...?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.610
My strength is overflowing...

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.930
Not only that, I don't feel the pain anymore.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:29.210
On top of that, the fatigue from 
staying up all night is gone...

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:29.910
It's awesome!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.670
That was just by chance...

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:32.880
Why you...!

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:38.830
Am I going to say something again?

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.250
I am, aren't I?

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.190
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.550
And fight your way toward the future!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.290
